<http://data.silknow.org/object/4b280488-ed48-37e9-93f9-b5b471f6ebb3/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The ground and the design are both of white cotton.  The design is woven with a pile like velvet.  Around the sides is a deep border.  The main field is covered with undulating vines and conventional, symmetrical forms.  In the middle is a lozenge bearing a crowned animal, two birds and a flower.  Made in three breadths and sewed together.  Lined with heavy white cotton.  Much discolored with age."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/4b280488-ed48-37e9-93f9-b5b471f6ebb3> .

